0. Terminology

⸻

0.1. “Cealith”, “The Pack”, and/or “This Pack” means the complete Cealith
Shaders software package distributed with this license agreement,
including its shader code, configuration files, assets, documentation,
and other files included in the package unless a file explicitly states
that it is covered by a different license.

0.2. “Official Source” means an official distribution page or repository
operated or authorized by the Cealith Shaders author, currently
including the official Cealith Shaders pages on Modrinth, CurseForge,
and GitHub.

0.3. “Normal Usage” means using This Pack for its intended purpose as a
Minecraft shader pack.

   Normal Usage includes, but is not limited to:
     a. Using This Pack during gameplay.
     b. Using This Pack in single-player or multiplayer gameplay.
     c. Using This Pack for screenshots, videos, livestreams, and other
        forms of content creation.
     d. Using This Pack for personal or commercial content creation,
        provided that the shader files themselves are not redistributed.

0.4. “User” means any individual using This Pack under the permissions
granted by this agreement.

0.5. “Modpack” means a collection of modifications, configuration files,
resource packs, shader packs, or other content distributed for
Minecraft: Java Edition.

0.6. “Modified Pack” means a copy or derivative version of This Pack in
which any shader code, configuration, asset, or other part of This Pack
has been intentionally changed.

0.7. “Redistribution” means making This Pack, any substantial portion of it,
or a modified version of it available to another person or third party
outside the permissions explicitly granted by this agreement.

   This includes, but is not limited to:
     a. Uploading the files to another website.
     b. Uploading the files to another file-hosting service.
     c. Creating mirrors or unofficial download pages.
     d. Re-uploading the files to another project page.
     e. Bundling the files for direct download outside an authorized
        Modpack distribution system.
     f. Selling or sublicensing the files.
     g. Distributing modified versions of the files.

0.8. “Official Distribution Platforms” means Modrinth and CurseForge, or
another platform explicitly authorized by the Cealith Shaders author.

1. Grants

⸻

1.1. Users are granted permission to use This Pack for Normal Usage.

1.2. Users are allowed to create and publish screenshots, videos,
livestreams, reviews, tutorials, benchmarks, and other content that
shows or uses This Pack.

1.3. Content created using This Pack may be monetized, including through
advertising, sponsorships, donations, subscriptions, or other
legitimate content-creation systems.

1.4. Users may include This Pack in a Modpack provided that all of the
following conditions are met:

     a. The Modpack does not modify This Pack.
     b. The Modpack does not provide a separately hosted direct download
        of This Pack outside the Modpack platform's normal distribution
        system.
     c. The Modpack clearly credits "Cealith Shaders" and "CoolSantyx"
        when the shader is included or enabled by default.
     d. The Modpack provides a link to an Official Source whenever the
        platform allows the Modpack author to provide project links.
     e. The Modpack author does not claim ownership of Cealith or imply
        that Cealith is their own work.
     f. Problems caused specifically by the Modpack's configuration,
        modifications, or other included content remain the responsibility
        of the Modpack author.

1.5. Modpack distribution through the normal systems provided by Modrinth
or CurseForge is permitted even when the platform technically stores
or distributes the required files as part of its normal Modpack
infrastructure.

1.6. Users may use This Pack for commercial Minecraft content, provided that
such usage does not involve selling, licensing, or redistributing
This Pack itself.

